{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/205888-blessing-kith-actions","id":205888,"title":"Blessing / Kith Actions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-23T03:40:05-07:00","id":205888,"title":"Blessing / Kith Actions","content":"How long does it take to activate a Blessing or Kith power? Are they instant or reflexive?<br /> I can see some being very powerful if they are reflexive.<br /> While others might be underwhelming if they are instant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2273-incendax","name":"Incendax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T08:37:41-07:00","id":206137,"title":"","content":"The books aren't usually very clear about this. However I tend to default to them being reflexive unless written in a fashion that implies otherwise.<br /> <br /> This is mostly because a lot of the powers in question are either constant boosts or supplemental powers (like getting bonuses to a specific roll). Having to spend a turn activating a power that just gives you a few bonus dice or 9-again to your next action seems silly.<br /> <br /> If the power is described as being an action of its own, then I treat it as an instant or even extended action as per its description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}